  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Life sphere (Fount Of Life), Protection sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever an ally within range of your cure ability that is under the effects of an aegis is damaged, you may spend a spell point as an immediate action to heal them with hit points from your fount of life. This may keep the target from dying.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/life#toc62\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
